== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=nr|Spider enemies that are neutralized by Bursting Sack cannot be poisoned by contact via {{i|The Virus}}, {{i|Serpent's Kiss}}, or turned into gold via {{i|Midas' Touch}}. They also become immune to contact damage from {{i|My Little Unicorn}}, {{i|The Gamekid}}, and {{i|The Nail}}, but not the ''damage'' from Midas' Touch or {{i|Little Horn}}.}}

